        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Hercules Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a combo pack for a front door. the set included a Single Cylinder Disc Deadbolt and a Passage Function Hercules Lever with concealed screw mounting. The Modern Stainless Steel Combo Pack comes with everything you'll need to update any door where a keyed lock might be required. The Disc Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Hercules Lever is made stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Disc Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Solid stainless steel lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Fastner Mechanism.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Door Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5.96\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.60\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Package includes: 2 passage function levers, single cylinder deadbolt, lever latch, steel bolt, strike plates, lever dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Stainless Steel Combo Pack",
                "description": "This is a combo pack for a front door. the set included a Single Cylinder Disc Deadbolt and a Passage Function Hercules Lever with concealed screw mounting. The Modern Stainless Steel Combo Pack comes with everything you'll need to update any door where a keyed lock might be required. The Disc Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Hercules Lever is made stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish.",
